<view class="page">
  <view class="card empty" wx:if="{{!hasMenu}}">
    <view class="empty-icon">🍳</view>
    <view>还没有今日菜单</view>
    <button class="btn-primary empty-btn" bindtap="onGoIndex">去生成今日菜单</button>
  </view>

  <block wx:if="{{hasMenu}}">
    <view class="card head">
      <view class="card-title">
        <text>{{dateLabel}} 购物清单</text>
        <text class="total-cost">预估 ¥{{totalCost}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="muted head-note">
        按 {{memberCount}} 口人份量换算 · 还需购买 {{buyableCount}} 样（已复制 {{copiedCount}}）· 点击条目打勾表示"已有/已买"
      </view>
      <view class="copy-all" bindtap="onCopyList">📋 复制全文清单备忘</view>
    </view>

    <view class="card howto">
      🛒 盒马/奥乐齐搜索框一次只能搜一样商品，请用<text class="hl">逐样采购</text>：点下方「下一样」复制食材名 → 切到盒马/奥乐齐粘贴搜索加购 → 切回来继续，进度自动记录。
    </view>

    <view class="card" wx:for="{{groups}}" wx:key="category" wx:for-item="g" wx:for-index="gi">
      <view class="card-title">{{g.icon}} {{g.category}}</view>
      <view class="divider"></view>
      <view
        class="item {{it.checked ? 'checked' : ''}} {{it.pantry ? 'pantry' : ''}}"
        wx:for="{{g.items}}"
        wx:key="name"
        wx:for-item="it"
        wx:for-index="ii"
        data-gi="{{gi}}"
        data-ii="{{ii}}"
        bindtap="onToggleItem"
      >
        <view class="checkbox">{{it.checked ? '✓' : ''}}</view>
        <view class="item-main">
          <view class="item-name">
            {{it.name}}
            <text class="copied-tag" wx:if="{{it.copied && !it.checked}}">已复制</text>
          </view>
          <view class="item-sub">
            <text>{{it.amountText}}</text>
            <text wx:if="{{it.priceText}}" class="item-price"> · {{it.priceText}}</text>
          </view>
        </view>
        <view
          wx:if="{{!it.pantry}}"
          class="copy-btn"
          data-gi="{{gi}}"
          data-ii="{{ii}}"
          catchtap="onCopyItem"
        >复制</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="bottom-space"></view>
    <view class="bottom-bar">
      <button class="btn-primary bar-btn next-btn" bindtap="onCopyNext">
        {{nextName ? '下一样：' + nextName + '（' + copiedCount + '/' + buyableCount + '）' : '✅ 全部复制完成'}}
      </button>
      <button class="btn-ghost bar-btn small" bindtap="onBuyAldi">奥乐齐</button>
      <button class="btn-hema bar-btn small" bindtap="onBuyHema">盒马</button>
    </view>
  </block>
</view>
